\" >Immerse yourself in this gradually unfolding strategic journey.Step to step, maybe you will become the master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036330/extras/0a87cdb5652921754bdda5f067b15c19.poster.avif?t=1758584113\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036330/extras/0a87cdb5652921754bdda5f067b15c19.webm?t=1758584113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036330/extras/0a87cdb5652921754bdda5f067b15c19.mp4?t=1758584113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Transport Legion&gt; Is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based game for deliberate planners (pause anytime, no rush).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About adapting, not memorizing solutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bit challenging, similar to a German-style board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hour sessions with no meta-progression grind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game with conservative numerical values, small yet precise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not Included:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No real-time reflexes or twitch gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rigid best build\u2014every run demands innovation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No A game that can be cleared without thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No repetitive grinding or meta-progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No endless number-chasing; just polished, meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The conpleted version of the game will contains 9 families and 4 levels of difficulty, while the demo version offers 2 families and 2 levels of difficulty.</p>","developers":["\u559